{"seq":2,"slug":"expect-actual","title":"expect/actual 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/expect-actual","wordCount":510,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"expect-actual-机制\">expect/actual 机制</h1><p><code>expect</code>/<code>actual</code> 是 Kotlin Multiplatform 的核心抽象机制。通过在公共代码中声明 <code>expect</code> 接口，在各平台模块中提供 <code>actual</code> 实现，实现了编译时安全的跨平台代码共享。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>expect</code>/<code>actual</code> 的核心是<strong>把平台差异显式化为编译期契约</strong>：公共代码用 <code>expect</code> 声明「存在这样一个能力」，各平台源集用 <code>actual</code> 提供实现，二者必须一一对应，缺一即编译失败。这样跨平台代码共享不再依赖运行时探测，而是由编译器保证声明与实现的一致性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本语法\">基本语法</h2><p>在 <code>commonMain</code> 中用 <code>expect</code> 声明，在各平台源集中用 <code>actual</code> 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain/kotlin/Platform.kt&#10;expect fun getPlatformName(): String&#10;&#10;expect class DeviceInfo {&#10;    val os: String&#10;    val version: String&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain/kotlin/Platform.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun getPlatformName(): String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect class DeviceInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val os: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val version: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// androidMain/kotlin/Platform.android.kt&#10;actual fun getPlatformName(): String = &quot;Android ${android.os.Build.VERSION.SDK_INT}&quot;&#10;&#10;actual class DeviceInfo {&#10;    actual val os: String = &quot;Android&quot;&#10;    actual val version: String = android.os.Build.VERSION.RELEASE&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain/kotlin/Platform.android.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun getPlatformName(): String = \"Android ${android.os.Build.VERSION.SDK_INT}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class DeviceInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual val os: String = \"Android\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual val version: String = android.os.Build.VERSION.RELEASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// iosMain/kotlin/Platform.ios.kt&#10;import platform.UIKit.UIDevice&#10;&#10;actual fun getPlatformName(): String = UIDevice.currentDevice.systemName()&#10;&#10;actual class DeviceInfo {&#10;    actual val os: String = &quot;iOS&quot;&#10;    actual val version: String = UIDevice.currentDevice.systemVersion&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain/kotlin/Platform.ios.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.UIKit.UIDevice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun getPlatformName(): String = UIDevice.currentDevice.systemName()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class DeviceInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual val os: String = \"iOS\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual val version: String = UIDevice.currentDevice.systemVersion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;expect fun getPlatformName()&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;actual (Android): &#39;Android 14&#39;&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;actual (iOS): &#39;iOS 17.0&#39;&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;actual (Desktop): &#39;JVM 17&#39;&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"expect fun getPlatformName()\"] --&gt; B[\"actual (Android): 'Android 14'\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"actual (iOS): 'iOS 17.0'\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"actual (Desktop): 'JVM 17'\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"可以使用-expect-actual-的声明\">可以使用 expect/actual 的声明</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>声明类型</th>\n<th>支持</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>expect fun platformName(): String</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>expect val isDebug: Boolean</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>expect class FileHandler</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>expect object Config</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>接口本身跨平台，无需 expect</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型别名</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>actual typealias PlatformList = ArrayList</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注解</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>expect annotation class Parcelize</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枚举</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td><code>expect enum class Theme</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"使用类型别名实现-actual\">使用类型别名实现 actual</h2><p>当平台已有完全匹配的类型时，<code>actual typealias</code> 是最简洁的实现方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect class AtomicRef&lt;V&gt;(value: V) {&#10;    fun get(): V&#10;    fun set(value: V)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// jvmMain&#10;actual typealias AtomicRef&lt;V&gt; = java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicReference&lt;V&gt;&#10;&#10;// nativeMain — 需要手动实现&#10;actual class AtomicRef&lt;V&gt; actual constructor(value: V) {&#10;    private val ref = kotlin.native.concurrent.AtomicReference(value)&#10;    actual fun get(): V = ref.value&#10;    actual fun set(value: V) { ref.value = value }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect class AtomicRef&#x3C;V>(value: V) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun get(): V</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun set(value: V)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// jvmMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual typealias AtomicRef&#x3C;V> = java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicReference&#x3C;V></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// nativeMain — 需要手动实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class AtomicRef&#x3C;V> actual constructor(value: V) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val ref = kotlin.native.concurrent.AtomicReference(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun get(): V = ref.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun set(value: V) { ref.value = value }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>actual typealias</code> 要求目标类型的所有成员签名与 <code>expect</code> 声明完全匹配，包括可见性修饰符。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"expect-actual-的约束与限制\">expect/actual 的约束与限制</h2><h3 id=\"1-成员必须完全匹配\">1. 成员必须完全匹配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect class Logger {&#10;    fun log(message: String)&#10;    fun debug(message: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// actual 必须实现所有 expect 成员&#10;actual class Logger {&#10;    actual fun log(message: String) { /* ... */ }&#10;    actual fun debug(message: String) { /* ... */ }&#10;    fun extra() { /* actual 可以有额外成员 */ }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect class Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun log(message: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun debug(message: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// actual 必须实现所有 expect 成员</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun log(message: String) { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun debug(message: String) { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun extra() { /* actual 可以有额外成员 */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-不能有函数体\">2. 不能有函数体</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect fun compute(): Int           // 正确：无函数体&#10;// expect fun compute(): Int = 42   // 错误：expect 不能有默认实现\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun compute(): Int           // 正确：无函数体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// expect fun compute(): Int = 42   // 错误：expect 不能有默认实现</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-接口不需要-expect\">3. 接口不需要 expect</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 接口本身是抽象的，天然跨平台&#10;interface Repository {&#10;    suspend fun getData(): List&lt;Item&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 各平台可以有不同的实现&#10;class AndroidRepository : Repository {&#10;    override suspend fun getData(): List&lt;Item&gt; = roomDatabase.getAll()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 接口本身是抽象的，天然跨平台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Repository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getData(): List&#x3C;Item></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 各平台可以有不同的实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AndroidRepository : Repository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun getData(): List&#x3C;Item> = roomDatabase.getAll()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需要跨平台抽象?] --&gt; B{需要平台特定实现?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{行为完全不同?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[直接写在 commonMain]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[expect/actual]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| F{有现成平台类型?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[actual typealias]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| E\">flowchart TD\n    A[需要跨平台抽象?] --&gt; B{需要平台特定实现?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C{行为完全不同?}\n    B --&gt;|否| D[直接写在 commonMain]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[expect/actual]\n    C --&gt;|否| F{有现成平台类型?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[actual typealias]\n    F --&gt;|否| E</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"平台特定实现模式\">平台特定实现模式</h2><h3 id=\"工厂模式\">工厂模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect object HttpClientFactory {&#10;    fun create(): HttpClient&#10;}&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual object HttpClientFactory {&#10;    actual fun create(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Android) {&#10;        install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual object HttpClientFactory {&#10;    actual fun create(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Darwin) {&#10;        install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect object HttpClientFactory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun create(): HttpClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual object HttpClientFactory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun create(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Android) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual object HttpClientFactory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun create(): HttpClient = HttpClient(Darwin) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"接口-expect-工厂\">接口 + expect 工厂</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;interface KeyValueStore {&#10;    fun getString(key: String): String?&#10;    fun putString(key: String, value: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;expect fun createKeyValueStore(): KeyValueStore&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual fun createKeyValueStore(): KeyValueStore = object : KeyValueStore {&#10;    private val prefs = context.getSharedPreferences(&quot;kmp&quot;, Context.MODE_PRIVATE)&#10;    override fun getString(key: String): String? = prefs.getString(key, null)&#10;    override fun putString(key: String, value: String) {&#10;        prefs.edit().putString(key, value).apply()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual fun createKeyValueStore(): KeyValueStore = object : KeyValueStore {&#10;    private val defaults = NSUserDefaults.standardUserDefaults&#10;    override fun getString(key: String): String? = defaults.stringForKey(key)&#10;    override fun putString(key: String, value: String) {&#10;        defaults.setObject(value, forKey = key)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface KeyValueStore {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getString(key: String): String?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun putString(key: String, value: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun createKeyValueStore(): KeyValueStore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createKeyValueStore(): KeyValueStore = object : KeyValueStore {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val prefs = context.getSharedPreferences(\"kmp\", Context.MODE_PRIVATE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getString(key: String): String? = prefs.getString(key, null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun putString(key: String, value: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        prefs.edit().putString(key, value).apply()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createKeyValueStore(): KeyValueStore = object : KeyValueStore {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val defaults = NSUserDefaults.standardUserDefaults</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getString(key: String): String? = defaults.stringForKey(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun putString(key: String, value: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        defaults.setObject(value, forKey = key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试-expect-actual\">测试 expect/actual</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonTest&#10;class PlatformTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun testPlatformName() {&#10;        val name = getPlatformName()&#10;        assertTrue(name.isNotBlank(), &quot;平台名称不应为空&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// androidTest&#10;class AndroidPlatformTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun testAndroidSpecific() {&#10;        val name = getPlatformName()&#10;        assertTrue(name.startsWith(&quot;Android&quot;))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class PlatformTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun testPlatformName() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val name = getPlatformName()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(name.isNotBlank(), \"平台名称不应为空\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AndroidPlatformTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun testAndroidSpecific() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val name = getPlatformName()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(name.startsWith(\"Android\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试位置</th>\n<th>运行平台</th>\n<th>测试范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>commonTest</code></td>\n<td>所有平台</td>\n<td>公共逻辑 + expect 接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>androidTest</code></td>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>Android actual 实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>iosTest</code></td>\n<td>iOS 模拟器</td>\n<td>iOS actual 实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>expect</strong> 在公共代码中声明平台相关的接口，<strong>actual</strong> 在各平台提供具体实现</li>\n<li>支持函数、属性、类、对象、类型别名、注解、枚举等声明类型</li>\n<li><strong>actual typealias</strong> 是最简洁的实现方式，适合平台已有匹配类型的场景</li>\n<li>expect 声明不能有函数体，actual 实现必须匹配所有成员签名</li>\n<li>接口天然跨平台，不需要 expect/actual</li>\n<li>常用模式：工厂模式、接口 + expect 工厂、typealias 映射</li>\n<li>公共测试在所有平台运行，平台测试验证各自的 actual 实现</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"expect/actual 机制","id":"expect-actual-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本语法","id":"基本语法"},{"level":2,"text":"可以使用 expect/actual 的声明","id":"可以使用-expect-actual-的声明"},{"level":2,"text":"使用类型别名实现 actual","id":"使用类型别名实现-actual"},{"level":2,"text":"expect/actual 的约束与限制","id":"expect-actual-的约束与限制"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 成员必须完全匹配","id":"1-成员必须完全匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 不能有函数体","id":"2-不能有函数体"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 接口不需要 expect","id":"3-接口不需要-expect"},{"level":2,"text":"平台特定实现模式","id":"平台特定实现模式"},{"level":3,"text":"工厂模式","id":"工厂模式"},{"level":3,"text":"接口 + expect 工厂","id":"接口-expect-工厂"},{"level":2,"text":"测试 expect/actual","id":"测试-expect-actual"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"KMP 项目搭建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/kmp-setup"},"next":{"title":"共享 UI (Compose Multiplatform)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/shared-ui-compose-mp"}}